# Hugging Face access token, required only for gated models.
# Cohere Transcribe is the only gated model in the registry — Voxtral, Parakeet and
# Whisper download without a token. Accept the terms on the Cohere model page first:
# https://huggingface.co/CohereLabs/cohere-transcribe-03-2026
# Create a token at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HF_TOKEN=hf_your_token_here
